    <briefdescription>
<para>Persistence interface for scraper output records. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_i_scraper_metadata_writer_1aa161e6904418a9f39b70ef089127463d" kindref="member">write()</ref> call persists one document to all three storage layers (relational, property graph, and vector). Partial-write failures are reported via <ref refid="structthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_write_result" kindref="compound">WriteResult</ref> without aborting the overall scraper run. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
